# Profiler output is machine-generated and regenerable, so it is not committed. The exception is
# a capture a write-up NAMES -- that one is the evidence for a number it quotes, and is force-added
# by name (see kernels/tm1/notes/.gitignore for the ones that earned it).
*.ncu-rep
*.nsys-rep
*.sqlite
*.ncu.log
ncu.status
*.txt
*.csv
